# Code owners for STELLA.
#
# An owner listed here is automatically requested for review on any pull
# request touching a matching path. The `main` ruleset requires code owner
# approval before merge, so these lines decide who can accept a change into
# the release branch.
#
# Two owners on every rule is deliberate: GitHub does not let anyone approve
# their own pull request, so a single owner would make their own PRs
# unmergeable without bypassing the ruleset.
#
# Later patterns win over earlier ones.

# Default owner for the repository.
*                       @DatMoser @tkowatsch

# Anything that can reach the UZH test or production servers.
/.github/workflows/     @DatMoser @tkowatsch
/scripts/               @DatMoser @tkowatsch
/k8s/                   @DatMoser @tkowatsch
/prisma/migrations/     @DatMoser @tkowatsch
